# A Primer on Professional Development.

**Authors:** Godshall, Clark J.

## Abstract
The components of professional development include staff development, peer interaction, benchmarking, and individual development. The New York State Association of School Business Officials has responded to demands for downsizing/increased productivity with professional development programs that mix both soft and hard skill development while maximizing professional development training opportunities across the state. (MLH)

